  "comment": "Nothing in this module reads a second channel: every input is taken as voltages[0] and every output is written as voltages[0], with no channel count set anywhere in the module. The record inputs are read only when one of the two is patched. The two selection CV inputs are taken as absolute values, so a negative voltage moves the point the same distance as its positive twin."
